  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The true stability tree held many wild Immortal Gu, among them several rank eight Immortal Gu including Peaceful Wind and Silent Wave. When Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable was still rank eight and traveling in Eastern Sea, a huge tsunami caused great harm. His own Immortal Gu could not stop the flood, so he sought to borrow those two rank eight Immortal Gu from the tree. The tree refused. In rage he fought it, killed it, retrieved the Gu, stopped the flood, and saved countless lives.",
